:: The Rooftop [event sister_quest] {"position":"4775,1775","size":"100,100"}
/* Quest "The Rooftop" (sister_rooftop), STAGE1_PROPOSAL.md 6.7. Optional: only if I offered her as $investor.callName's hostess
   in The Introduction ($flags.retailIntro "sister"). Entertain, public risk, and I'm in the room this time, so it isn't a
   report. In the office I ask her to host; she says yes before I've finished the sentence. We agree on a signal: a touch
   on my ear means yes. On the rooftop $investor.callName takes to her, and later a man from $retailChain.name puts his
   hand on her waist, and she looks across the terrace for me. Giving the signal is the whole scene.
   The introduction is free either way. Everything (sister_everything) is the night after.
   The choice is kept in $sister.flags.rooftopSignal. After the drive home I can ask her about the corner by the heaters:
   her POV passage (Sister Rooftop POV), whose <<EndPov>> takes me home to bed ($povReturn). It has no effects, so the
   scene finishes (ReturnFromEvent) before the link is offered. */
<<silent>><<SetBackground $locations[13].img>><</silent>>
At six the office is empty except for us. She's at her desk, packing up, and I stop next to it with my hands in my pockets.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $player, text: "Are you busy tonight?" },
{ who: $sister, text: "Is that a trick question? I'm never busy anymore, I muted my whole life, remember?" },
{ who: $player, text: "There's this evening on a rooftop downtown, an investor and some people from $retailChain.name and probably very good wine. He needs a hostess, and I'd like it to be you. I'd want you to..." },
{ who: $sister, text: "Yes." },
{ who: $player, text: "I haven't even told you what it..." },
{ who: $sister, text: "Whatever it is, yes." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She says it so fast she has to laugh at herself afterwards. Then she asks what to wear, and when I tell her she goes a little pink and says okay.

<<linkreplace "Agree on a signal">>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $player, text: "I'll be there the whole time, across the room mostly. If you're not sure about something, look at me." },
{ who: $sister, text: "Not sure about what?" },
{ who: $player, text: "Anything, really. Someone gets a little too friendly, or someone wants you to stay for one more drink." },
{ text: "She looks at me for a moment, and I get the feeling she understands a lot more than she's letting on." },
{ who: $player, text: "If I touch my ear, it's fine, let it happen. If I don't, smile and find a reason to go get somebody a drink." },
{ who: $sister, text: "A secret signal. That is the most spy-movie thing you've ever said to me, and I'm a little embarrassed for both of us." },
{ text: "But she touches her own ear, testing it, and she doesn't laugh." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<linkreplace "The rooftop">>
<<silently>><<SetBackground "images/locations/rooftop.jpg">><</silently>>
<<Media "images/characters/sister/events/the_rooftop/terrace.jpg" 600>>
/* A rooftop terrace at night, string lights, the city behind, well-dressed people with wine glasses, Sister in a dark dress near the bar */
$investor.callName's building is the kind with a doorman who knows your name before you give it. The rooftop is all glass railings and string lights and little heaters shaped like torches, and beyond it the whole city, lit up and silent, like a model of itself.

$sister.callName is in the black dress I picked, the one with no back, and heels she practiced walking in for an hour in the hallway. She takes coats and brings drinks, she remembers everybody's name after hearing it once, which I didn't know she could do, and she laughs at the right moment at every bad joke on the terrace.

$investor.callName takes to her within ten minutes. He walks her around the terrace with one hand barely touching her elbow, introducing her to everyone as "the charming young lady from that clever little company", and she charms them, one by one, while I stand by the railing with a glass of wine I'm not drinking and watch her work.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $investor, text: "Mr. $player.surname. Your $sister.relation is a revelation. Where on earth have you been hiding her?" },
{ who: $player, text: "Behind the office coffee machine, mostly." },
{ who: $investor, text: "A crime. An absolute crime. The people from $retailChain.name are quite taken. I'll make the introduction on Monday. Consider it done." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<linkreplace "Later">>
Near eleven, the wine has done what wine does. One of the men from $retailChain.name, a big man in a gray suit with a wedding ring and a laugh you can hear from the elevator, has her in a corner by the heaters, telling her a long story about a fishing trip. His hand has found the small of her back, where the dress isn't, and as he talks his fingers move a little, slowly, back and forth.

She's smiling at him, with her shoulders very straight.

Then, over his shoulder, she looks across the terrace, straight at me, with the question we agreed on in the office five hours ago.

<<Media "images/characters/sister/events/the_rooftop/look.jpg" 600>>
/* Sister in a corner by a patio heater, a man's hand on her bare back, her eyes looking past his shoulder toward the camera */

She's waiting. The whole terrace is laughing and talking, and she's waiting for me to move my hand.

<div id="rt-choice" class="choices">
<div><<link "Touch your ear">><<replace "#rt-choice">>
I lift my glass with my left hand and touch my right ear with two fingers, as casually as I can, the way you'd brush away a strand of hair.

She sees it, and something in her face settles. She turns back to the man in the gray suit and laughs at the end of his story, a little louder than before, and she lets the hand stay. When he leans in to say something in her ear, she lets him do that too. When he puts his other hand on her hip, she looks across at me once more, quickly, and I don't look away, and she doesn't move it.

She only looks away from me when she's sure.

On the drive home she sits with her heels in her lap and the window down, looking at the city go by. Somewhere around the bridge she reaches over and takes my right hand off the gearshift and holds it, and touches my ear with one finger, very lightly, and lets go.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $sister, text: "Did you see $investor.callName's face when I remembered his wife's name? I thought he was going to adopt me on the spot." },
{ who: $player, text: "He practically did. He's making the introduction on Monday." },
{ who: $sister, text: "Good. That's good." },
{ text: "She talks about everyone from the terrace on the way home, the doorman and the heaters and $investor.callName's wife, everyone except the man in the gray suit." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<set $sister.flags.rooftopSignal to true>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterExhibition" 4>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterCorruption" 4>>
<<UpdateStat "-" "SisterResistance" 2>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "Corruption" 3>>
<<Feel $sister "player" -1>>
<<Feel $sister "investor" -1>>
<<ProfileLog $sister "The Rooftop" "She hosted $investor.callName's rooftop evening for the company, in the black dress I picked. Late in the evening a man from $retailChain.name had his hand on her bare back and she looked across the terrace at me for the signal. I touched my ear. She let him. The introduction is free.">>
<<ProfileMemory $sister "The signal" "In the car she took my hand off the gearshift and touched my ear with one finger, very lightly, and let go. On the way home she talked about everyone from the terrace except him.">>
<<NextQuest $sister>>
<<AdvanceTimeTo 6>>
<div class="navigation-link"><<link "Ask her about the man in the gray suit">><<set $povReturn to "Bedroom">><<goto "Sister Rooftop POV">><</link>></div>
<<ReturnFromEvent "Home" "Bedroom">>
<</replace>><</link>></div>
<div><<link "Leave your hand where it is">><<replace "#rt-choice">>
I keep my hand on the railing.

She watches for a moment longer, to be sure. Then she smiles at the man in the gray suit, touches his arm, says something about his glass being empty, and slips out from under his hand toward the bar as if that had been her plan all along. He laughs and lets her go. He doesn't seem to mind. He's had a lot of wine.

She brings him a fresh glass and someone else a napkin and $investor.callName a joke that makes him clap his hands, and for the rest of the evening she stays where I can see her, and keeps glancing at me as if I'd done something kind.

On the drive home she talks nonstop about the doorman and the heaters and the man's fishing story, which apparently ended with a bear. Then, at a red light, she goes quieter.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $sister, text: "Thanks for not touching your ear." },
{ who: $player, text: "You'd have done it, though, wouldn't you?" },
{ who: $sister, text: "Yeah. That's kind of why I'm saying thanks." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

<<set $sister.flags.rooftopSignal to false>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterExhibition" 2>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterCorruption" 2>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 2>>
<<Feel $sister "player" 1>>
<<ProfileLog $sister "The Rooftop" "She hosted $investor.callName's rooftop evening for the company, in the black dress I picked. Late in the evening a man from $retailChain.name had his hand on her bare back and she looked across the terrace at me for the signal. I didn't give it, and she slipped away to the bar. The introduction is free anyway.">>
<<NextQuest $sister>>
<<AdvanceTimeTo 6>>
